uploads/
└── a1b2c3d4e5f6/          ← random 12-character ID for each upload
    ├── mymodel.fbx         ← your original file (never changed)
    ├── meta.json           ← {"main": "mymodel.fbx"}
    ├── preview.glb         ← made only when a preview is needed
    └── rigged.glb          ← made only if you choose Auto Rig
